---
// Footer.astro - stopka Raporty24
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5 bg-slate-950 pb-12 pt-24 text-white">
  <div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="mb-20 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="lg:col-span-1">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="mb-8 block text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter text-white transition-colors hover:text-slate-200"
          aria-label="Raporty24 - strona główna"
        >
          RAPORTY<span class="text-green-500">24</span>
        </a>

        <p class="mb-8 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Tworzymy narzędzia dla firm, które chcą ograniczyć ręczne raportowanie,
          uporządkować dane i zautomatyzować powtarzalne procesy w Excelu, Power BI,
          Pythonie i aplikacjach desktopowych.
        </p>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/raporty-raporty-50a8413a4/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white transition-all hover:bg-[#0077b5]"
            title="LinkedIn Raporty24"
            aria-label="Raporty24 na LinkedIn"
          >
            <i class="fab fa-linkedin-in text-slate-950 transition-colors"></i>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://www.tiktok.com/@raporty24"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white transition-all hover:bg-[#ff0050]"
            title="TikTok Raporty24"
            aria-label="Raporty24 na TikToku"
          >
            <i class="fab fa-tiktok text-slate-950 transition-colors"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-8 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-green-500">
          Usługi
        </h4>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/excel-na-zamowienie/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Excel na zamówienie
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/makra-vba/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Makra VBA
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/dashboardy-power-bi/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Dashboardy Power BI
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/logistyka-w-excelu/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Logistyka i planowanie tras
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/optymalizacja-excela/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Pomoc i optymalizacja Excela
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a
              href="/uslugi/"
              class="underline decoration-transparent transition-colors hover:text-white hover:decoration-green-500"
            >
              Wszystkie usługi
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-8 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">
          Nawigacja
        </h4>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/realizacje/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">
              Realizacje
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a href="/blog/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">
              Blog
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a href="/cennik/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">
              Cennik usług
            </a>
          </li>

          <li>
            <a href="/subskrypcja/" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">
              Wsparcie SLA
            </a>
          </li>
<li>
  <a href="/uslugi/ksef-do-excela/" class="hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">
    KSeF do Excela
  </a>
</li>

<li>
  <a href="/uslugi/kalkulatory-produktowe/" class="hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">
    Kalkulatory ofertowe
  </a>
</li>

<li>
  <a href="/uslugi/skrypty-python/" class="hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">
    Skrypty Python
  </a>
</li>

<li>
  <a href="/uslugi/integracje-api/" class="hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">
    Integracje API
  </a>
</li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kontakt/" class="text-green-500 transition-colors hover:text-green-400">
              Kontakt
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-8">
        <h4 class="mb-4 font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white">
          Masz proces do automatyzacji?
        </h4>

        <p class="mb-8 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          Podeślij opis procesu, screen arkusza albo przykład raportu. Sprawdzimy,
          czy da się to uprościć w Excelu, Power BI, Pythonie albo aplikacji desktopowej.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-6 space-y-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          <a
            href="/realizacje/"
            class="flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-check text-green-500"></i>
            KSeF Exporter Pro
          </a>

          <a
            href="/realizacje/"
            class="flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-check text-green-500"></i>
            System planowania tras
          </a>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/kontakt/#formularz"
          class="block rounded-xl bg-green-600 py-4 text-center text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white transition-all hover:bg-green-500"
        >
          Poproś o wycenę
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-12 md:flex-row">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-600">
        &copy; {currentYear} Raporty24. All rights reserved.
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-green-500"></i>
          Obsługa zdalna:
          <span class="text-white">Polska, Niemcy, UK</span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600">
          Siedziba:
          <span class="text-white">Katowice, Śląsk</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>